The agent mode's step prompts, the sample-checker semantics, the sample problem
(sample/) and the parity-test scenarios in tests/test_team_solve.py are adapted from
Memdoor (https://github.com/guregodevo/memdoor, examples/workflows/team-solve at commit
4b7ca6e239cbc777fe8135410cd6771414242713), licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0). Changes: the prompts' memdoor paths and run
identifier template were replaced with this skill's checker and run id; the workflow
engine was replaced by teamsolve/agents.py; the checker was ported from bash to Python
and extended to functional (starter-code) samples.
